    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49a41d2ead9fc7c4bd7f4d77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要在这座舞台上展现目白家的光辉。\n胸怀这番意志的目白光明\n即将挑战“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07361a8ac459794bd535c68185c694f9a789efc5004581c3e99e1c737c4f7493",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
