    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55448b9be56f661a5207564e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明贯彻了自我步调作战。\n虽然起跑时速度很慢，\n但她仍成功后来居上，顺利留下好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f14b28b1a6d24f5639028ff8efc19dfbbe07ce9aefd8f440f0db5963c4883c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85c8d50a31541cee8dda959",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce6aa673f037af7473c86249",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次作战奏效了。\n但在训练员眼里看来，接下来她是否还能\n维持自己的步调继续前进呢？实在令人担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c4f257d30c486f44977257d2224459716087bb14121610f5afc22c519484d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e120d2f002a93abbe34f3e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b46ed804ffc8705644ca3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是训练员提议安排大量比赛行程，\n想让她学着习惯忙碌的感觉。\n但她却轻轻地摇了摇头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab6b8d6ca7581dca1508a5eb13b18bf6dbcc4aa08a38c828b0acef7d02a72e73",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea30f132727fa85be7edd173",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16198062258d3c0a7ee62d4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与其慌忙，慢慢地扎实锻炼比较适合自己。\n她的意志很坚定，她想悠闲安稳地做准备，\n好赢得GⅠ，为目白家尽一份心力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2ed387f97c58b89b92e3a00c263a52ad04e9338e14d80631b0a6edaec5644d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5866fe2a82fbcf44b1c96f6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
