    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752e48916d1ae900a9fba45f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的目标是GⅠ竞赛“希望S”。\n更上一层楼并不是件轻松的事，\n但训练员决定相信她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3dc0a212769f1d26300524cf66533d95b08a2e8e4845bc58cc978198ee78c0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0377c18fa1d91228a6ad65d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・传说级的轻松写意",
      "source_fingerprint": "c40d81bd2dbccbf2dca7f5cfe385c5aacdbe43a51470d5e99a007ff98e761c80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074418.json",
