    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ce8c8a18ffa6914481548c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明顺利地在GⅠ大显身手。\n她具体地感受到自己的实力，\n比赛结束后跟训练员分享这份喜悦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b9e4d0729b5755b8e9eac6d2d10e11634279b599c0c4e1bba76beb1ad24727f",
