      "uid": "zhcn:4c5228bc557a883bf5d6204d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明与目白多伯谈起了\n往后的计划。此时，目白光明说出\n目标是“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c84d70e472feb0683618778836ad81fe1dd6db1afa16d0865ecfc5d582f8724b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
