    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beaa36a3a702fe29d8d9d454",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明想挑战“经典三冠”。\n而目白多伯则欲夺下“三后冠”。\n她们约好，两人都要为目白家献上荣耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "754e30e5da70fa3db0cd681d4c9866267c181ef1a53b830348ca54ca7667158c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074419.json",
      "json_path": [
