    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aa320eb2cacbddff8a5d6ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明漂亮地赢得“皋月赏”，\n拿下三冠之一。能为目白赖恩弥补\n当年遗憾让她非常开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb4cf74113ac9167b4c2dc477cb21762eb8d1a8893c9c0ec3391657e31355dfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
