    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85dd87d5b1f6091d6f45f29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为目白赖恩当年之所以表现不佳，\n正是因为背负了太多\n目白家的重责大任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72cafe65e5a7c7933904ae24b700c036eee7540d950343929b9999e0b758040f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074420.json",
      "json_path": [
