    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be94c0e10175d83ce5b3aeca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很遗憾地“皋月赏”之冠落入他人手里。\n没能替目白赖恩弥补当年懊悔，\n目白光明不禁露出不甘心的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e325ea82e43b6a6935e6c99bfc6e77cd690a627b31e83217263d4f076920d5cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
