    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fec2ea00362436af4b1b7876",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望光明为了自己而跑──\n目白光明露出笑容回应这份心意，\n并开始准备应战接下来的“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91c8a0430534866b559057038c9c22083999ab8c7aed9a53ca3c0f84e75ec4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
