    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0272c5989adfe5f2cdacd01d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "皋月赏结束后・二代的了结",
      "source_fingerprint": "71388dbbcd7f478bf664bae25156719cf3aaa65d10607daac0a6fd5236b3c47e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48345b7bb28a0b21aa939e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明彻底发挥了自己的特色，\n她面对大舞台“日本德比”时仍未动摇，\n跑出了精彩的好表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6173a0822150ce168c9e89f81b1727b80e472f110864e005ba6cb7c4f7c5645f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df73e29f03facc2fc2f462e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明贯彻了属于自己的跑法，\n她的身影让无声铃鹿不再迷惘，\n并发誓接下来将去见识自己真心追寻的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e98cc1cc0186be2a5c90544478a547d0ac48fef19f143b34122abb990491b2df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac3aefec9f39d4eb7380046a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白光明的下一个目标是“菊花赏”。\n她表示完全不考虑其他目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99b798d46cc05e7f9a16ecfef0143037c101226f042e84bad9000745cfe50d83",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0435746ae17e35e16dd702d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家相当重视“天皇赏”、“经典三冠”等\n权威性比赛，对她们来说，\n“菊花赏”也是非得赢得的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7aa4966db978d68d70b268ae9043c7fef8bc788bad5475bebd6f3546a0af5f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d9eec552e26d5df8df7ef95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白家所追寻的事物就是我想获得的事物──\n目白光明的意志无比坚定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b32caf4a9f3f88306e79f7c854edd22912d6b2450590280a00b918e4aea9ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
